a-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;declaration&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;declarationMap&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;sourceMap&quot;: true&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"declaration\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"declarationMap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"sourceMap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>生成的映射关系：<code>消费者看到 .d.ts → .d.ts.map → 原始 .ts 源码</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>声明文件是 TypeScript 的&quot;类型合约&quot;，<code>declaration: true</code> 启用生成</li>\n<li><code>stripInternal</code> + <code>@internal</code> 标签精确控制公共 API 边界</li>\n<li>DTS Bundling 将多个 .d.ts 合并为单一入口，主流工具有 api-extractor / dts-bundle-generator</li>\n<li><code>afterDeclarations</code> Transformer 可以在生成后修改声明文件</li>\n<li>Declaration Map 支持从声明跳转到源码，提升库用户体验</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>兄弟文档：<a href=\"incremental-compilation\">增量编译与 Watch 模式</a>——增量模式下声明文件如何利用签名缓存</li>\n<li>跨库链接：<a href=\"../../typescript/modules-and-declarations/declaration-files\">TypeScript 声明文件</a>——从使用者角度理解 .d.ts 文件的语义和编写规范</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"声明文件生成与 Bundling","id":"声明文件生成与-bundling"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"编程方式生成声明文件","id":"编程方式生成声明文件"},{"level":2,"text":"@internal 与公共 API 控制","id":"internal-与公共-api-控制"},{"level":2,"text":"声明文件 Bundling","id":"声明文件-bundling"},{"level":3,"text":"方案对比","id":"方案对比"},{"level":3,"text":"编程实现简易 DTS Bundler","id":"编程实现简易-dts-bundler"},{"level":2,"text":"afterDeclarations Transformer","id":"afterdeclarations-transformer"},{"level":2,"text":"Declaration Map 与 Source 导航","id":"declaration-map-与-source-导航"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"增量编译与 Watch 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript-compiler-api/advanced/incremental-compilation"},"next":{"title":"实战架构模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript-compiler-api/advanced/practical-patterns"}}